    {
      "occurrence": 38,
      "number": 117,
      "number_raw": "117",
      "source_number": "117",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我是卡勒布，这儿操练组织都归我管。",
      "source_text": "我是卡勒布，这儿操练组织都归我管。",
      "source_line_start": 41,
      "source_line_end": 41,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 39,
      "number": 118,
      "number_raw": "118",
      "source_number": "118",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Yah, I guess. You got the Blades up north, a pretty pathetic herd# of people, and the Gun Runners a little north and a ways to the east# through the DeathClaw Playground.",
      "source_text": "Yah, I guess. You got the Blades up north, a pretty pathetic herd\n# of people, and the Gun Runners a little north and a ways to the east\n# through the DeathClaw Playground.",
      "source_line_start": 42,
      "source_line_end": 44,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 40,
      "number": 118,
      "number_raw": "118",
      "source_number": "118",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "好吧，北边是利刃帮那些可鄙的混球，往北再往东走，穿过死亡爪出没的地方，就是军火商。",
      "source_text": "好吧，北边是利刃帮那些可鄙的混球，往北再往东走，穿过死亡爪出没的地方，就是军火商。",
      "source_line_start": 45,
      "source_line_end": 45,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 41,
      "number": 119,
      "number_raw": "119",
      "source_number": "119",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Also, a ways to the south of here you have the Children of the Cathedral,# who run a hospital an' a big church. Up a little bit to the north and to# the east you got the loony Followers of the Apocalypse, who are all peace-types.",
      "source_text": "Also, a ways to the south of here you have the Children of the Cathedral,\n# who run a hospital an' a big church. Up a little bit to the north and to\n# the east you got the loony Followers of the Apocalypse, who are all peace-types.",
      "source_line_start": 46,
      "source_line_end": 48,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 42,
      "number": 119,
      "number_raw": "119",
      "source_number": "119",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "出城往南走是大教堂教徒的地盘，他们有一家医院和一座教堂。往北走再往西是末世论者的图书馆，他们都是安分的人。",
      "source_text": "出城往南走是大教堂教徒的地盘，他们有一家医院和一座教堂。往北走再往西是末世论者的图书馆，他们都是安分的人。",
      "source_line_start": 49,
      "source_line_end": 49,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
